# Archived / deprecated materials — kept on disk for audit but not in source
# control. The contents are documented in DEPRECATED.md / ISOLATION.md inside
# each subdirectory. New experiments MUST NOT import anything from here.
#
# Currently tracks:
#   archive/method_dev/  — frozen 2026-10-13; reasons in
#                          archive/method_dev/DEPRECATED.md
#
# Allow only top-level README / ISOLATION / DEPRECATED *.md inside archive/
# so editors / readers can navigate without re-importing the scripts.
archive/
!archive/README.md
!archive/**/*.md
